      "section": "Section spots",
      "order": 3,
      "alignment": "left",
      "vertical_alignment": "top",
      "body": "An H&E skin section (epidermis over dermis) saved as a SpatialData store, which also holds spot shapes, nucleus points and an AnnData table. The viewer shows the store's image element; the spot table is exported to a CSV that the cards, filters and table read. Clusters group spots by stain and nuclear density, so C1 is the most hematoxylin-rich. The four gene counts are synthetic. Lasso spots to filter.\n",
      "wf_tag": "python/bioimage_demo"
    },
